IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `rtva-licensing`

-- Road Traffic (Vehicles) Act 2012 (WA), Part 2, s 4, 5, 7, 10; Vehicles Regulations r 15, 16, 21, 51, 54, 54A, 57, 99, 100;
-- Administration Regulations r 4, 22; Administration Act s 6, 7; MVTPI Act s 4(8A), 20, 21 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. The figures come from the deposited Act
-- and regulations; nothing here has been checked against a decided case.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_road-traffic-vehicles-act-2012_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Life facts used are from the workbench scenario au/wa/cradle-to-grave-chloe/facts.json: Chloe born 14 March 2003; c074
-- (15 June 2034, age 31): she buys a used car for $28,000, already licensed. HYPOTHETICAL: the car's tare (1 400 kg) and
-- GVM (1 900 kg); the duty of $770 (the scenario's own expected figure; the Duties Act 2008 was not read here); a CTP
-- premium of $450; every other fixture.

§ `fixtures`

`Chloe's used car` MEANS `My vehicle` WITH
