    `it is being towed by a licensed or permitted tow truck` IS FALSE
    `it is designed to be propelled by human power through its pedals` IS FALSE
    `it is a pedalec meeting EN 15194` IS FALSE
    `combined maximum output of its motors in watts` IS 0
    `its GVM in kg` IS 1900

