`a transfer with a licence warning notice in force` MEANS `My transfer application` WITH
    `my age in years` IS 31
    `it is a heavy vehicle` IS FALSE
    `I have given the proof of age and identity the CEO requires` IS TRUE
    `I have paid the transfer fee and the duty` IS TRUE
