    `days since the notice was issued` IS 30
    `further days the CEO allowed beyond 28` IS 0
    `I have applied for the transfer` IS FALSE
    `I did not agree to become an owner and told the CEO in writing` IS FALSE
    `another person has been nominated as owner` IS FALSE
